    "Privacidad": "Privacy",
    "Cuéntanos tu caso y seguimos por WhatsApp": "Tell us about your case and we'll continue on WhatsApp",
    "Cuéntanos tu caso": "Tell us about your case",
    "Aviso legal | Hechos Abogados": "Legal notice | Hechos Abogados",
    "Cláusula suelo, gastos de hipoteca, IRPH o tarjeta revolving: te decimos qué podrías recuperar, sin adelantar nada. Miramos tu contrato gratis.": "Floor clause, mortgage set-up costs, IRPH or revolving credit card: we'll tell you what you could get back, with nothing to pay upfront. We'll review your contract for free.",
    "Una noticia dice que el banco te debe dinero y no sabes si va contigo. Miramos tu contrato gratis y te decimos qué se puede reclamar, sin que adelantes nada.": "A news story says the bank owes you money and you're not sure if it applies to you. We'll review your contract for free and tell you what can be claimed, with nothing for you to pay upfront.",
    "Qué incluye": "What's included",
    "Cláusula suelo, gastos de la hipoteca, IRPH y tarjetas revolving. Cada una se reclama de forma distinta y depende de cuándo firmaste y de si ya reclamaste antes.": "Floor clause, mortgage set-up costs, IRPH and revolving credit cards. Each is claimed differently, depending on when you signed and whether you've claimed before.",
    "Cláusula suelo": "Floor clause",
    "Limita cuánto puede bajar el interés de tu hipoteca.": "It limits how far the interest rate on your mortgage can fall.",
    "Gastos de la hipoteca": "Mortgage set-up costs",
    "Son los que el banco te cobró al firmar y en muchos casos le correspondían a él.": "These are the costs the bank charged you on signing, which in many cases should have been its own to pay.",
    "Otro índice de referencia, distinto del euríbor, que en algunos casos se puede reclamar.": "Another reference index, different from the euríbor, which in some cases can be claimed back.",
    "Tarjeta revolving": "Revolving credit card",
    "Tiene un interés muy alto y va sumando deuda sobre deuda.": "It has very high interest and keeps piling debt on top of debt.",
    "El plazo": "The deadline",
    "No hay un plazo único para reclamar cláusulas bancarias: depende del tipo de cláusula, de cuándo firmaste y de si ya reclamaste antes. Si firmaste antes de 2013 suele haber más margen; entre 2013 y 2019, o después, depende del caso. Te lo miramos gratis.": "There's no single deadline for claiming on bank clauses: it depends on the type of clause, when you signed and whether you've claimed before. If you signed before 2013 there's usually more room; between 2013 and 2019, or later, it depends on the case. We'll check it for free.",
    "Cómo lo hacemos": "How we do it",
    "Primero": "First",
    "Miramos tu contrato": "We review your contract",
    "Sin coste.": "At no cost.",
    "Segundo": "Second",
    "Reclamamos al banco": "We claim against the bank",
    "Sin que adelantes nada.": "With nothing for you to pay upfront.",
    "Tercero": "Third",
    "Si hace falta, vamos a juicio": "If necessary, we go to court",
    "Seguimos sin que adelantes nada.": "Still with nothing for you to pay upfront.",
    "Cuarto": "Fourth",
    "Te avisamos de cada movimiento": "We keep you posted on every step",
    "En menos de 48 horas.": "Within 48 hours.",
    "Lo que podrías recuperar": "What you could get back",
    "Lo que podrías recuperar depende del capital de tu hipoteca o de lo que has gastado con la tarjeta:": "What you could get back depends on your mortgage principal or on what you've spent with the card:",
    "Cifras orientativas y redondeadas.": "Figures are approximate and rounded.",
    "Cláusula": "Clause",
    "Entre 500 € + 0,4 % del capital y 1.000 € + 0,9 % del capital": "Between 500 € + 0,4 % of the principal and 1.000 € + 0,9 % of the principal",
    "Cláusula suelo (firmada antes de 2013)": "Floor clause (signed before 2013)",
    "Entre el 2,5 % y el 6 % del capital": "Between 2,5 % and 6 % of the principal",
    "Entre el 1,5 % y el 5 % del capital (siempre hay que estudiarlo caso a caso)": "Between 1,5 % and 5 % of the principal (it always needs to be assessed case by case)",
    "Entre el 15 % y el 45 % de lo gastado en total con la tarjeta": "Between 15 % and 45 % of the total spent with the card",
    "Cifras orientativas y redondeadas; el importe exacto se calcula con tus datos en «¿Tengo caso?». Honorarios: 0 € por adelantado. Si el banco es condenado en costas, cobramos de ahí; si no, un 10–15 % + IVA de lo recuperado.": "Figures are approximate and rounded; the exact amount is calculated with your details in «Do I have a case?». Fees: 0 € upfront. If the bank is ordered to pay legal costs, we take our fee from that; if not, 10–15 % + VAT of what's recovered.",
    "Caso de ejemplo": "Example case",
    "Gastos de la hipoteca, capital de 150.000 €, firmada en 2015. Recuperable orientativo: entre 1.100 € y 2.400 €. Honorarios: 0 € por adelantado; si no hay condena en costas, 10–15 % + IVA de lo recuperado.": "Mortgage set-up costs, principal of 150.000 €, signed in 2015. Estimated recovery: between 1.100 € and 2.400 €. Fees: 0 € upfront; if there's no order for legal costs, 10–15 % + VAT of what's recovered.",
    "Preguntas frecuentes": "Frequently asked questions",
    "¿Cuánto me va a costar reclamar?": "How much will it cost me to claim?",
    "Nada por adelantado. Si el banco es condenado en costas, cobramos de ahí; si no, un 10–15 % de lo que se recupere. Si no se recupera nada, no nos pagas honorarios; lo único que podría quedar a tu cargo, si se perdiera el juicio, son las costas del banco, y ese riesgo te lo explicamos antes de empezar.": "Nothing upfront. If the bank is ordered to pay legal costs, we take our fee from that; if not, 10–15 % of what's recovered. If nothing is recovered, you don't pay us fees; the only thing that could fall to you, if the case were lost, is the bank's legal costs, and we explain that risk before we start.",
    "¿La primera consulta es gratis?": "Is the first consultation free?",
    "Sí, miramos tu contrato sin coste antes de decirte nada.": "Yes, we review your contract at no cost before telling you anything.",
    "¿Se me ha pasado el plazo?": "Have I missed the deadline?",
    "No hay un plazo único: depende del tipo de cláusula, de cuándo firmaste y de si ya reclamaste antes. Te lo miramos gratis.": "There's no single deadline: it depends on the type of clause, when you signed and whether you've claimed before. We'll check it for free.",
    "¿Qué pasa si el banco ya me devolvió algo?": "What if the bank has already paid me something back?",
    "Nos lo cuentas en el test. Cambia lo que todavía se puede reclamar, pero no impide mirar el resto del caso.": "Tell us in the test. It changes what can still be claimed, but doesn't stop us looking at the rest of the case.",
    "También llevamos": "We also handle",
    "También llevamos divorcios y separaciones, y negligencias médicas, tanto de la sanidad pública como de la privada.": "We also handle divorce and separation, and medical negligence, in both public and private healthcare.",
    "Divorcios y separaciones": "Divorce and separation",
    "¿Crees que es tu caso?": "Think this is your case?",
    "Cuéntanos qué ha pasado.": "Tell us what happened.",
    "Cláusula suelo, gastos e IRPH | Hechos Abogados": "Floor clause, costs and IRPH | Hechos Abogados",
    "Cuéntanos qué te ha pasado o llámanos. La primera valoración de tu situación no tiene coste.": "Tell us what happened or call us. The first assessment of your situation is free.",
    "Cuéntanos qué ha pasado y te decimos en qué podemos ayudarte. Si prefieres no escribir, puedes llamarnos.": "Tell us what happened and we'll let you know how we can help. If you'd rather not write, you can call us.",
